  "notes": "Release 077, PREREG_review_077.md (run TB): EviCon on a device-management platform, ThingsBoard CE 4.3.1.6's persistent server-side RPC (a command record with the lifecycle QUEUED, SENT, DELIVERED, SUCCESSFUL, TIMEOUT, EXPIRED, as cloud IoT command services offer), with the contract `measure thingsboard` measures in the same review run for the gateway's call shape (thingsboard-rpc-r0: Q_A by reading the RPC record, T by its expirationTime; no D_h: every attempt is a new RPC). Policies EVICON, M1 and NAIVE (M1 without the T4 retry guard: a blind retry, the real-system negative control), W = 6, same seed 20261017 as C (episodes 0-5 replay C's arrivals and fault windows); offline windows take the device's MQTT connection to ThingsBoard down. Runner: evaluation/campaign_tb.py; gateway conformance/reference/tb_owner_gateway.py."
